 "description": "Copy of \"anchor: product-user\" that sends resource_type when it creates a role or permission. It replaces the original once ADR-0022 PR 1 is deployed. Product user create / read / search / delete, duplicate email and validation refusals, one not-found code (PRODUCT_USER_NOT_FOUND) on the user and its organization routes, membership read-back, delete idempotent (204) and emits product_user.deleted exactly once, and every event checked in one final webhook wait.",
